---
description: MonsoonMesh project and data provenance rules
alwaysApply: true
---

- Keep all risk scores explicitly labelled as illustrative decision-support indices, never validated flood probabilities.
- Label synthetic fixtures and simulated results; do not describe them as live observations.
- Enforce authentication and role checks in the API, not only in the web client.
- Validate external input, use parameterized SQL, and never commit secrets.
- Keep recommendation approval human-controlled; never dispatch emergency resources autonomously.
